	<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#action">
		<comment xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Verb phrase describing WHAT must/must not/may be done. Source: compliance_action.</comment>
